# Reference.cs (WinForms/NETCore): svcutil-generated WCF service-reference proxies (see
# their own <auto-generated> header). ReportExecutionServiceSoapClient.CloseAsync() hides
# ClientBase<T>.CloseAsync() by design in the generated shape - the fix (adding `new`) would
# be a hand-edit to generated code, silently lost on the next svcutil regeneration. Suppress
# via .editorconfig instead of editing the file. See tasks/remaining-warning-cleanup.md.
